pages.text:
Dugukolo dilannen bɛ ni fɛn ninnu ye:

- **fɛn gɛlɛnw** i n'a fɔ fɛn ɲɛnamaw tɔw ani kuluw;
- **ji** min kɔnɔ dugukolo lafɛnw bɛ;
- ani **fiɲɛ**.

Fɛn ɲɛnama minnu hakɛ bɛ milimɛtɛri damadɔw la, olu fana bɛ sɔrɔ dugukolo kɔnɔ:

- **akariyɛnw** (acariens);
- ntugun fitininw minnu bɛ wele ko **nematodiw** (nématodes);
- **bɛbɛw ka ntɔnɔw** (larves).

Dugukolo kɔnɔ bɛbɛ fitininw fana bɛ sɔrɔ yen (**kologitaw** - invertébrés) i n'a fɔ:

- **kɔrɔbɔtɔw** ani **ntugunw** (vers de terre);
- **ntɔnɔw** ani **dimiw**;
- **nkorongocow** ani **ntalɛnw**.

**Sɔmɔni tɔw** bɛ fɛn ɲɛnamaw tɔw di. Ka kɛɲɛ ni u hakɛ ye, an bɛ se ka u fara a kan:

- walima **kɔnposi dingɛ** kɔnɔ walisa ka kɔnposi sɔrɔ;
- walima **bɛnɛ cɛsiraw** binfiri jukɔrɔ walisa ka **sanfɛla kɔnposi** dilan.
